# Topic permissions for the broker WITH A PASSWORD (mosquitto/auth.conf and native.conf).
# There is no anonymous access there at all; the only user is the system itself:
# the detector, the brain and the CLI use one login from .env (PAWSIGHT_MQTT_USER).
# Everything the project publishes and subscribes to is under pawsight/ (pawsight/bus.py).
user pawsight
topic readwrite pawsight/#
